<title>INDIA: TABLE-Indian April fertiliser output rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Indian April fertiliser output rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's fertiliser output rose in April compared with the same month in 1996, the government said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    PRODUCTION	April    April	 Apr-Mar   Apr-Mar</p>
<p>			   1997     1996	 1996/97   1995/96</p>
<p>    Nitrogenous     712.3    491.4	 8,599.4   8,777.0</p>
<p>    Phosphatic	222.5    164.6	 2,555.9   2,558.0</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
